  "title": "Four-mode 4-bit Circuit: X, X+1, X', and X'+1",
  "description": "Use XOR gates and exactly one 7483 to select one of four operations: X, X + 1, X', or X' + 1. The selection is determined by the control signals S_1 and S_0: 00, 01, 10, 11 respectively. A 7404 inverter is prohibited.",
